  "notes": [
    {
      "id": "41aed7d6-4cfc-4236-a998-85ce0176f56c",
      "text": "一、询价（spi.alipay.commerce.logistics.carshipping.inquiry.query）",
      "position": "over",
      "lifelineIds": [
        "36ed3f2d-b0d3-444c-b3e1-dfa5965a8380",
        "1194d713-47c3-43a8-929c-8c02d87aa8fb"
      ],
      "afterOrder": -1
    },
    {
      "id": "e8aad74b-bd4d-40dd-8d00-265b6890a0e9",
      "text": "[{\n\t\"price_id\":\"1111111\",\n\t\"mileage_fee\":100000,//1000元\n\t\"order_fee\":100000,//1000元\n\t\"before_discount_fee\":100000,//1000元，无优惠\n\t\"deposit_fee\":30000//定金300元\n\t\"transport_type\":\"LARGE_TRUCK\"//大板运输\n\t....\n}]",
      "position": "over",
      "lifelineIds": [
        "1194d713-47c3-43a8-929c-8c02d87aa8fb"
      ],
      "afterOrder": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "width": 354.35999999999996
    },
    {
      "id": "e15fdbc1-1bb3-488a-b3fb-665457086e9e",
      "text": "二、下单（spi.alipay.commerce.logistics.carshipping.order.create）",
      "position": "over",
      "lifelineIds": [
        "36ed3f2d-b0d3-444c-b3e1-dfa5965a8380",
        "1194d713-47c3-43a8-929c-8c02d87aa8fb"
      ],
      "afterOrder": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "230754bd-4f85-4092-84c1-2e76a2cca80a",
      "text": "{\n\t\"price_id\":\"1111111\"\n}",
      "position": "over",
      "lifelineIds": [
        "36ed3f2d-b0d3-444c-b3e1-dfa5965a8380"
      ],
      "afterOrder": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "edab9204-c027-45ff-83f9-ce84cc32d8c1",
      "text": "三、用户支付了定金，后期线下沟通，增加了提送车费用（无需通知支付宝订单金额变化？）",
      "position": "over",
      "lifelineIds": [
        "36ed3f2d-b0d3-444c-b3e1-dfa5965a8380",
        "1194d713-47c3-43a8-929c-8c02d87aa8fb"
      ],
      "afterOrder": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "371ce630-f451-497f-838e-7e9b030c75d9",
      "text": "{\n\t\"business_order_no\":\"YC12787283\",//运车管家订单号\n    \"alipay_trade_no\":\"2222\"//300元定金支付交易单号\n}",
      "position": "over",
      "lifelineIds": [
        "1194d713-47c3-43a8-929c-8c02d87aa8fb"
      ],
      "afterOrder": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "5cea65a0-b4bd-425c-ad7c-f7e2d247cd37",
      "text": "四、订单状态变为CS_SERVICE_COMPLETED，给用户推送尾款账单",
      "position": "over",
      "lifelineIds": [
        "36ed3f2d-b0d3-444c-b3e1-dfa5965a8380",
        "1194d713-47c3-43a8-929c-8c02d87aa8fb"
      ],
      "afterOrder": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "6dc9e9dd-8949-4b2f-803f-9c2b8503a630",
      "text": "{\n\torder_status:\"TO_PAY\",//待支付\n\tmileage_fee:120000,//订单总金额1200（增加了200）\n\torder_fee:120000,//订单总金额1200（增加了200）\n\tadditional_fee:20000,//与原始报价对比增加的钱\n\talipay_trade_no:\"2345\"//尾款900元（增加了200提车费）的支付宝交易单号\n}",
      "position": "over",
      "lifelineIds": [
        "1194d713-47c3-43a8-929c-8c02d87aa8fb"
      ],
      "afterOrder": 4
    }
  ],
